<p>Liverpool Jan/Mar 124.00</p>
<p>London Spot 117.00 Nov 117.00 Dec 119.00</p>
<p>Feed wheat Norfolk/Suffolk Oct 101.00/100.50/100.00 Nov 102.50/02.00/01.50/01.00/100.00 Jan 101.50 Apr/Jun 105.00</p>
<p>Yorkshire Nov 99.00 Jan/Mar 102.00 Apr/Jun 105.00</p>
